{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1487,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e59185b4b377324eb2c2e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然只身一人做的梦也很不错，\r\n但两人一起追逐超级远大\r\n又火热的梦想……光想就很兴奋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e612297ca3809592c2c7381afa22583fddcc43c517be22cf3dbe18d03d10b4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0add56a762eeb46d4063a57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套制服真时髦哪～",
      "source_fingerprint": "624053db453896eff8de31f44ab105e2a0d73edb018656f9e42adc6d842808cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d6d1a709a7ca9848d98ac74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌在舞台上的活跃表现\r\n也要尽收眼底啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2193dbbc3771d9eaf8f3c87e67536c6f8a02f8d08fa3371dbe49c5b46baa2fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cde6c7a4033f84125d52d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌登场！\r\n打起精神上场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5d3836be3533ed221b3466c1d5584a39434d77cdece95e20080c6ff06bccd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:491dfc130fac56206c345191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校规应该禁止把运动裤\r\n穿在裙子底下吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "644c9a30a246b8013b5e74d8da0f0ce549a84305bdcea006218989b0f9e3a211",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:739d53aeb34ddfdd587e5124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟大家穿一样的衣服是也不错啦……\r\n但能不能在背后刺上刺绣啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec1fdd5b3e02ccb5f82747e73e1ad506121dc3652489d77a286afa3e4cd023b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f89843ac0e311d436eb343b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，追逐我的背影，\r\n将我的名字铭刻在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1094995df2cb4ef5b5958202576f01190074b176fc919682cd67f1607175f6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bddaa4649a6dd6563be69416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦～还有这种的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c149207cbe058ac65c13f2d3256e34446353c472c071c2fcf55f2d21e86a9065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d57bbe0871667ddae02dfed6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦帮我拍张照。\r\n我想寄给父母看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc866f4b6b1a0b561fb07922fb0cdb4b2360071c6fa232ef1854a13ca6b5727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c778a01e07aee4bb809a906f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょっとブラつこうぜ\r\nあんたも来いよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62e3a5ff53be0b83a2ed435f99f916e834882aaa1efcf4c628dc6ab97079dbc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a61238605a5693cc0b2727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スカジャンに興味あんのか？\r\n龍派？虎派！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c48b4fcd982bdb2f0eece8becf6ad54639cfb50fb9260927c9e8096ad03a3d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4436651313d122b7d19efeac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套制服真时髦哪～",
      "source_fingerprint": "624053db453896eff8de31f44ab105e2a0d73edb018656f9e42adc6d842808cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cc7bf7f17f0254b7de86d20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌在舞台上的活跃表现\r\n也要尽收眼底啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2193dbbc3771d9eaf8f3c87e67536c6f8a02f8d08fa3371dbe49c5b46baa2fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cb9c02025906ac8e08526cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌登场！\r\n打起精神上场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5d3836be3533ed221b3466c1d5584a39434d77cdece95e20080c6ff06bccd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80a60bb2450690b46ffb7db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校规应该禁止把运动裤\r\n穿在裙子底下吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "644c9a30a246b8013b5e74d8da0f0ce549a84305bdcea006218989b0f9e3a211",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b1c465afdee6d053692f77c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟大家穿一样的衣服是也不错啦……\r\n但能不能在背后刺上刺绣啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec1fdd5b3e02ccb5f82747e73e1ad506121dc3652489d77a286afa3e4cd023b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9022d5340c84519af5908dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，追逐我的背影，\r\n将我的名字铭刻在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1094995df2cb4ef5b5958202576f01190074b176fc919682cd67f1607175f6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a87cba2a8860403772b0ff42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦～还有这种的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c149207cbe058ac65c13f2d3256e34446353c472c071c2fcf55f2d21e86a9065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd1bd7ab4f6024021479438",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦帮我拍张照。\r\n我想寄给父母看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc866f4b6b1a0b561fb07922fb0cdb4b2360071c6fa232ef1854a13ca6b5727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d75c402d28f9f791382898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2844e10231fb1df80ddf92369741a345d71164ac359effd4df72193851603d28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea6b1767fced58ab61234ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊～你今天也很有精神呢！\r\n我也不能输给你。\r\n看我拿出王牌风范，鼓起干劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8436d836c2b2f6e568a09e63bbac69bff631d0cc3624a55b1a018f1ce1f22f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08c8d6cec794a5fc041166c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我属于起床后能立刻清醒的那种人，\r\n甚至能够起得比鸡还早哦！现在都没\r\n对手可以跟我匹敌了，真没干劲呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71dc49c1b4fe13550cc5f7c3d715da6a6006b319ec1f139ea029ceab9ce1a81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7862eeb3a551200d2ec4a27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好好吃过饭了吗？还没的话这些\r\n给你！我用老家种的米做了饭团，\r\n但不小心一鼓作气做太多……哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ffd08e4dbe83f101271a403e6950b71a26848e1f4257f9a59a978f493174779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e03947e08b0c53e32dd92cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要打倒面前的高墙。\r\n这样才叫王牌啊……嗯。我接受\r\n这份挑战……数学课后辅导……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd121e999421f1554334bec82d418b19353ddf45be8c93bd9e098861e19b99e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ec63cf6ebf604ebc9e8eb61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在家乡时常遇到牛在半夜生产。\r\n这可是件攸关生命的大事，\r\n所以我都会立刻跳下床去帮忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e351fa5c3347d0f7715d1dd529dabb7b219021757a0c8304d9ef7375a97c89b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd0c12618b3aa1b392bf5820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈说厕所有鬼出没让她很害怕。\r\n出现在厕所真是太坏心了！\r\n我去骂骂那个鬼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0334eead7a1ee18351a9dc5d9a28bc31918e36dd3f0cf544f882b7c02b6c3fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb7ae318c3e10d1ce9e405db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我家乡有条有名的樱花林荫道，\r\n略带深粉色的花朵既鲜艳又耀眼！\r\n看到会让人心情忍不住好起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02d6aa640e0fc0cbe81b4a2224424d59f13aa51407d49d33593e7a94374848b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c3268e5a82d494ba37fe44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "补充水分之余也别忘了盐分啊～\r\n还要戴帽子，然后再披条毛巾保护好\r\n后颈，在室内也别大意哦？还有……",
      "source_fingerprint": "784c918ac92e34690043b7ef0ed6e4ce0b8c5e6c08982a9d9f96cd907947b6a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2079689d75128f49e394be8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就想到金黄色的稻田！\r\n结实累累！哎呀～看见那景色就觉得\r\n有回报了～！好期待新米收成啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d62b1081596820e37ea845582ad47067bb68851c0af7841d68881332d8416ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4da69dd3164eb6bc02e08b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯？训练员你怎么啦，嘴唇有点\r\n发紫耶。晚点为你煮点姜汤吧，\r\n可别着凉了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e462fa53ee19679d624e4b512396f07da68c40ea99965e98f6da0227575201fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51af37d71fa79d6d2dd233d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ef8d795d41e442824d3553b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千明对任何事都不会视而不见。\r\n像上次她还把垃圾捡回给乱丢\r\n垃圾的人……和她相处起来很畅快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20da56843b9d3555ddcffc65d1d1ff4ac5d115025e2f841d0e59a00c2d932633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae555c17b45b935025a9bb72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生会长无论做什么都完美无缺，\r\n明明很忙但比赛时又强得要命。\r\n鲁道夫真的不会分身术吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1a1860919c6efebc65ca17112c4e2bbf55d8b08d477274f9a1aa9b2632042a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8318d3ef87a9c1ec849a01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信真的教了我很多！像是大都市的\r\n用词啊、一些礼仪啊，还有化妆\r\n技巧……得好好报答这份恩情才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf4861ca499d3cf42c69732780201b2f1b6bf149d53d3912cad010e4fee63a08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b97e386b66b87335a7c138",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实真要说的话，我以前身体并不算\r\n健壮，连想下田帮忙都会被阻止呢。\r\n呵呵，现在可是让人心服口服啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2731340dcaad1100020155bd8e3111a9f93812f1041342ea6e49066c8fda87bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c4811140df5cf0f1961cfd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前还在家乡时有位大叔很看好我。\r\n不晓得他过得好不好呢……？\r\n写封信问候他吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eb473ae5ca214dbce25345c38adbc007be95a7ffe1eeb0a1c35a1fd592dc039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aa5e2c08e7efe1c7844885c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前露出肚脐都会被骂，\r\n要我遮起来。现在却要在演唱会\r\n特地露出来啊……这就是时髦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "330abd512c9eacc981d49d633cf8a59f72084098935d5f308ef214fe67ee9c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b631c3007ff2ae9ba308527f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，有没有哪里怪怪啊？\r\n上次我就不小心\r\n把后面的衣摆夹进裤子里了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01eb47e5aca5c205ebc8e80a43f387ba2d80dbd9d93cd13053d5e54f2e409908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c81cb49ab1aa3a2f3eab0285",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是穿上就让内心变得火热不已……\r\n太棒了！看这隐藏在内里的刺绣！\r\n我也要像这条龙一样大展身手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2cbe290c61723209f0adf3604886252d87b25b1d85f190ffe3f8e81600562b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192fc183f8dfc130080051a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要成为叛逆的王牌。\r\n这套服装就是象征旗帜。\r\n任谁看了都能一目了然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f046f66c6ec44d312544419b8d2cc4b7223f2d56aff85826f8573a475b51122e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a73e190384768850ef94245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上我去河岸跑步时遇见千明。\r\n那家伙居然又走了一整晚！\r\n所以我就扛着她去上学了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "768821242fb3594d5d63ed02c2d94e2d0b828e758451bbd9707bcdfd2c911e81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5deb25acc5b1dceb4c5d40f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……天气好时就总是忍不住……\r\n不！这样太没有「王牌」的样子了！\r\n我要拿出气势！气势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "935cba9fdf5763f6e29bded9d75be6b908703af967f07354f051eedf75beb536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb7b87e65b68d66fbb3242d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天又过去了。大家都说我洗澡\r\n洗很久。泡在浴池里就会忍不住\r\n想唱歌嘛，总要唱上整整十首歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5bfd6a119add0c6e2f29fb1c75a11ceb9ccd92e7d88f2623a49408dae22fd4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:186148d1663d2add635b2fd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听到新生们诉说了梦想……\r\n嘿嘿！简直棒极啦！\r\n我最喜欢怀着火热意志的家伙了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df8be9324e2f451c0fa04205c232a0ffdc68cfed8a31aa86f42839cd9ca40f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c174c443495a755e7043a868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搞砸了……我不小心对在试胆大会\r\n扮鬼的人说出「辛苦啦！」……\r\n我的神经太大条了吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52839936da3f7a27f695e0697b692bdfb09d0d51970a7cf338dee00a295a7630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8044b3db43b947bf915b24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天虽然气候舒适却有台风～！\r\n拟定防台措施也不轻松……\r\n有没有消灭台风的方法啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f9e73b689902dbdbe30190efb55c91f769cd953e61fba42d077853e5d3ec7f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88b6f1d54f8196b3f0bc05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒冷的冬天早上起床时，偶尔会很\r\n想念煤油暖炉的气味呢。那种暖炉\r\n一开就会立刻热起来，超棒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ebfbaf1f97eaf7e272a87e909f73191203e49525b4e7d9ea769d9502a5e9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7240e1e64de5295b263f7754",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做些什么？\r\n为了变强，我什么都做得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1013b76d0e9cfc2e4d7f5849cbb5787b97718d5871044ea42c3ed494698f399b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f689cc6a28a0d04fdeabcf8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おっし、行くぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f902d7524c4d3df7ecbcacfcd7792f77669ce28eb42c33328a6457763107817e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23b851edabd2ee34f95a559e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～开始吧……！\r\n训练员，\r\n今天也请多多指教～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23feca54f54801f6207e550e410f1794f5866f44e1bba4bdad8c958a9a17f010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5710abb65be3ec35891390af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "周遭的家伙要怎么讲我都无所谓。\r\n总有一天我绝对会还以颜色，\r\n将「王牌」之名刻在每个人心中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a31fdc0faeed7c4aa95464e6a79e3f2ac1dcf9fb18cb29130e5bd0077b76c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eba5b3dec6d151a9bc882798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，千明那家伙也要练跑啊……\r\n嘿嘿，那我也去稍微跑一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae17b8fb47154a0783ac204be85fa01b7d25c0628882864d30d02664c42c4e71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f00884092908e85d1f05aae4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢红色，不仅能让人鼓起\r\n干劲，又有种熊熊燃烧的感觉！\r\n我这发饰也很帅气吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd5879b961c367820fa76e46e2e0a1e767ee7eb7e8141a46911adeb3f246dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e456680e24e2e58780bb01e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员平常也会固定练跑吗？\r\n要去跑步时记得找我喔！\r\n我也要陪你一起跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47835dc0d185e3723d21f500630fc79eacb9923e9b9aedb32e35e412bb584cb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2efb5348252fd7404fc1c3c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕是我无法独自抓住的梦想，\r\n有你陪着就绝对能够实现！嘿嘿，\r\n我可是深信到甚至敢如此断言哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "995388d976bda0f10e72514258d1d6b8c0e92141856889d8b21ca83e90187a7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b8ca9577dabbc4f36f94d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～好热！\r\n连太阳都充满干劲呢！\r\n我也不能输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20bfdb90fe491818e72a7d72c910567008ea5399cefd4496e58de36bbc1b9c05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c64b202e2bc553b49c92dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管梦想再远大我都要亲手抓住。\r\n这是你教会我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce23251912068c73c951daa2d3f267175e2f2b54083815329226a58405e5e877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b13c684e97cc0bc7ba75dc13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我甚至连常识都成功颠覆了呢！\r\n这都要感谢训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fc8146934a3a8a1cd7c2e825ca021e48168e17e36c6334f47adbbe929f620aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff4fef96cb8ee0099a513310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会不断变得更强喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d92798162fd049bf7f525ff8f92b4869780795f5af31bb4b2aa79f0ee3e2550c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5213a8cf29cbe08a635a31ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才没有极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f8ce9805a8b0824b5d95460f53bcab39c1ed2ea8ccc1d8fb4fe157441c2a68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ff179b7b8dedada164838c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦！我是葛城王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a7b0faaa3111be030da901b61eed8731e447e18ee4a475c270587684a665b35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0850db35b700204d86cfe08c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "颠覆一切常识──\r\n叛逆的王牌就在这里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3527f598ee621392fa70abfcd8f99b94e78943611764f7200c8aa2c362b61714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15ac738fe4526a1a418394c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起变得更强吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c97a854861016747f276bfbe04949faeee7bb718890b7b382f089fb70a1aca11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7596d739352e4e7d38c008a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得还能表现得更精彩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3708ff20facf06004b0434a836c8781aa847501ad6957c166a8038244d4fac89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:396a7cc9dd37826289cbdcc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始倒数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8221b3cc29ad43be1328cc2df3e14feff6c04081f5298facc5137131ca79386",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d68e2628a2dd54047543d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "邂逅……消除隔阂的开始。\r\nSphilar一直都在。\r\n一直都支持着「我」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "633d56a5a094a3517eafe4a49a57fc82b5d8b256fedac1712725664275ce1e41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de445af88676a1488c6127b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "探査開始、するね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "121f167147ba56d10d201920a5b3270e95ad203a3240bac338f6234841b3c3f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ed5e195290938bf72ed0ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰還、したよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "690de72e64d1bfb251f7cc4ce663b227de372b22219996ad6739298367ac8fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53a203f2fa5edf1a7c4ab32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使对你来说难以理解，你仍旧\r\n与我进行了「CMIN」。所以我也会\r\n继续落实「有状况就回报」的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e3fa8328925ce8b80a1b40673dd7740c3eed5611bd8938920d189067e84293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ca1a6a5d87a29324da6ae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「观测」……被「观测」……两者都\r\n存在着「开心」哦。总有一天是否\r\n能实现「同步」呢……？耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f298819277b4c68f99fc64657e6860998f8a9d298879a445c7089dbe14a50af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f4236d4fb7c9e74c0719fb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每年都会将写了消息的风筝\r\n升上天空，等待着「回答」哦。\r\n今年总该要收到回复了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d31de5a2062859a4171655ccafc203e0f8613f1180954bd2e4687dcfb02481e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777f1f8d9bbe4c1d09d9ab0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把「真空干燥」的巧克力蛋糕……\r\n送给你了。赏味期限为二十五年。\r\n还能让你带去月球旅行喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e48d2e59c645292383ed9a5699f0868de4130747bd5efbbf4c77f33fbc6fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a329cad7e574ec21841d0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我「HEMD」了送你的巧克力……\r\n是星星造型喔。希望没融化。\r\n毕竟我的心一直「暖呼呼」的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0052652f6ede8e288e880c55c4ac51014774f399d577aad835c50623f2e512c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d976d3594145dc1c2f9150a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "牛郎与织女相见之夜。彼此距离\r\n十五光年……来得及见到对方吗？\r\n我一直在思考该如何帮助他们……",
      "source_fingerprint": "374ffd4d310315b2e7d094388c8d26defd678b18a3f634c2301791f456efaf09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0407d6436010a1a4159bd738",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有多达八只脚，甚至连语言都能够\r\n改变的完成度。那是属于「高水平」\r\n的变装。我好想给他更多糖果啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61e0feb8682649dd9c1ecfd72107e80f3d2330e017c6697051dd735679dde2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d94e83f38664bdd20517d5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有在今天，每个人都会抬头仰望。\r\n虽然只是树顶的星星，但也很像一起\r\n在「观测」……很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84fb03e94d0b950ab6f1e4eeeae47da3fd47c7973a447ac53ceeab342147306",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7876e6e0bafa547dbd57d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们家会在星空皎洁的圣诞夜里，\r\n一起进行天文观测。我对参宿四倾注\r\n心愿，下次……你也要一起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9488abae8c79c189db66241456085c6023a400131ed8da009172ffb007787b88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fcacf204bd19c42d20ead82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成果无可挑剔呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a03cb0d5e3e927798fb9fd2ab75b0262a7fd8116bf21d2c884d530decf7c33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7500f9ffe3fcb270545cb3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回首过去一年……是我的例行公事。\r\n不晓得我距离目标又前进了「多少\r\n秒差距」……？存在着「期待」呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcecbf7e013dfa7273ee3960106f4c660b6096c22adfa3d617e1ddee877b8ec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e76566174326534c597cbae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每晚都在「观测」着星星的动向。\r\n我一直在等这个周期到来喔。\r\n「祝你生日快乐」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab40036ec3f2008d7f1ec88ab8a126b37192314a0cef9cf52e9d1715a97385c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "10011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
